# PaperIntelligenceV1

Repository: `~/Paperintelligencev1/repo` · Prefer worktree `worktrees/subha` on `dev/subha` for Subha-owned work.

## Stage diagram

```
ingest → relevance → normalize_authors → screen → GATE(ai_relevance)
  → affiliation_fast → audience_domain → quality (QUALITY_ENGINE=terra|jev_glm)
  → affiliation_deep (HTML→ROR→OpenAlex) → affiliation_judge → hf_signals
  → adjudication → reports
```

See `docs/pipeline_flow.md`. Ingestion / shared Radar tables are **existing** — do not rebuild.

## Golden scoring rule

**Dataset:** `quality_scoring_golden_v1` (`golden/quality_scoring_golden_v1.xlsx`).  
Scoring changes are measured against **human** labels in `golden_human_scores`, **never** against another model's scores. Baseline: `reports/golden/baseline_v1.md`.

## Invariants

- Evidence never overwritten (append-only); current state is derived
- Four layers: raw · model outputs · adjudicated · canonical current
- Unknown beats wrong org; `organisation_id` may be NULL for unlisted
- Store paper→author→org→evidence, never bare paper→org
- External clients return data only; stages decide meaning
- Independent stage/prompt/policy versions; no global pipeline version
- Stages idempotent and independently rerunnable
- Paid stages require `--from`/`--until`; print scope before work
- Prompts/policies are versioned files — never edit an existing version in place

## Constraints

- OpenRouter only · RDS Postgres schema `paper_intelligence`
- No agent frameworks in runtime · no alternate architecture folders
- Agents write migrations but **do not apply DDL**
- Do not mark own work complete — Verifier only
- Agent sequence never parallel: Architect → Scout → Engineer → Verifier → fix → commit

## Development cycle

Start: `git status && git fetch origin && git rebase origin/main`, then read Context → State → stream State → stream Backlog.  
End: tests → golden when applicable → update backlog/state → commit code+MD together → push.

## Boundary with Urmila

Subha owns canonical semantics and enrichment policy. Urmila owns cache, client implementations, observability, golden loaders/eval behind Subha interfaces. Coordinate interface changes via State.md — do not silently change contracts.

## M1

**200+200 Golden Replayable** — every golden paper must be fully provenance-traceable and comparable to labels (manual vs llm_adjudicated scored separately).
